@startuml UC6_SearchBikePath_Design
autonumber "<b>0:"
title [UC6] Search for a bike path

' =======================================================
' COMPONENT DEFINITION
' =======================================================
actor "User" as User
participant "Mobile Application\n(Tier 1)" as Client

' External Service (Geocoding)
participant "MapServiceProvider" as Map

' Backend System
participant "BBP API Gateway\n(Tier 2)" as GW
box "BBP Application Server (Tier 3)" #LightBlue
    participant "PathSearchEngine" as Search
end box
participant "BBP BikePath DB\n(Tier 4)" as DB

' =======================================================
' ENTRY CONDITION
' =======================================================
note over User, Client: Entry Condition: User presses "Search" to find a path

' =======================================================
' (a) GPS DETECTION & INIT
' =======================================================
User -> Client: clickSearch()
activate Client

' Acquisizione locale sensori
Client -> Client: acquireSensorData(GPS Position)

' =======================================================
' (b) ORIGIN SELECTION
' =======================================================
Client --> User: displaySearchForm(CurrentPosition)

alt Use Detected GPS Position
    User -> Client: selectPosition(CurrentGPS)
    note right of Client: Set Origin = Current Coords
else Use Manual Input
    User -> Client: selectPosition(NewAddress)
    
    ' Smart Client: Geocoding prima della ricerca
    note right of Client: Convert Address to Coords
    Client -> Map: getCoordinates(Address)
    activate Map
    Map --> Client: OriginCoords (Lat, Lon)
    deactivate Map
end

' =======================================================
' (c) DESTINATION SELECTION
' =======================================================
Client --> User: requestDestination()
User -> Client: insertDestination(DestAddress)

' Smart Client: Geocoding Destination
Client -> Map: getCoordinates(DestAddress)
activate Map
Map --> Client: DestCoords (Lat, Lon)
deactivate Map

' =======================================================
' (d) PATH RETRIEVAL AND SCORING
' =======================================================
' Invio della query con le coordinate già pronte
note right of Client: Request paths matching Origin/Dest
Client -> GW: GET /api/paths/search?origin=..&dest=..
activate GW

note right of GW: Routing to Search Engine
GW -> Search: findBestPaths(SearchCriteriaDTO)
deactivate GW
activate Search

' Query al DB: Trova percorsi vicini e ordinali per Score
note right of Search: Query logic: Proximity & High Score
Search -> DB: findPathsByProximityAndScore(Origin, Dest)
activate DB
DB --> Search: List<PathEntity>
deactivate DB

' Conversione in DTO leggeri per la lista
Search -> Search: rankAndConvertToSummary(List)

Search --> GW: 200 OK (List<PathSummaryDTO>)
deactivate Search
activate GW
GW --> Client: 200 OK (List<PathSummaryDTO>)
deactivate GW

Client --> User: displayPathSelection(ranked_paths)

note over User, Client: Exit Condition: User presses "View" or "Exit"

deactivate Client
@enduml